# Intent Routing Contract

Canonical doc: `docs/intent-routing-contract.md`.

## Labels (must stay aligned)

`CHECK_BALANCE`, `PAY_CREDIT_CARD`, `TRANSFER_OWN_ACCOUNTS`, `TRANSFER_THIRD_PARTY`, `AMBIGUOUS`, `OUT_OF_SCOPE`

Sync across: `IntentLabel.kt`, JSONL datasets, `intent_heuristic.json`, mobile string comparisons.

## Ownership

| Layer | Owns |
|-------|------|
| `local/` + `api/intent/` | Classification (TF-IDF, heuristic, LLM eval) |
| `BackendRouteResolver` | Intent → API route hints |
| `ChatRoutingPolicy` (mobile) | Presentation: clarification, out-of-scope card, flow entry |

Do not duplicate classification logic in mobile — consume API response.

## Before merging classifier changes

```bash
python3 local/scripts/train_intent_classifier.py --eval
python3 local/scripts/simulate_intent_validation.py
python3 local/scripts/simulate_dialogue_validation.py
```

## Unimplemented routes

Transfers return `implemented = false` — UI must not promise success; show unavailable or guide only.

## Threshold changes

Document in `docs/intent-routing-contract.md` and add/update tests in `ChatRoutingPolicyTest` or backend classifier tests.
